#. Description of the plugin
#: sm-insights.php
msgid "Business report of the steel market (Business plan): average asked prices per type of profile, new and reused, steel put on sale (new, reuse, buildings), the most searched and best-selling profiles (ranking only), what is in demand and little offered, figures per region, and a summary written by the AI from these figures. Only asked prices, weights on sale and counts of listings, searches and requests: no company name, no quantity or amount of sale. Requires SM Core and SM Products."
msgstr ""

